          "data": {
            "text/html": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert\"><h2 id=\"run-batch-parallel-multi-species-growth\">Run batch parallel multi-species growth</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>here we run the trained NCA model (vmapped across batches) from multiple initial conditions at once</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "4f03390d74082cc2fe55e909c9af1ea8",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert\"><h2 id=\"one-big-batch-including-multiple-initial-conditions\">One big batch including multiple initial conditions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>We can reshape the initial conditions to have 1 large lattice with multiple initial conditions. Do the different growing structures interact then?</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
